{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":10,"translation":"KJV","url":"/bible/proverbs/10","verses":[{"verse":1,"text":"The proverbs of Solomon. A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish son is the heaviness of his mother.","words":[["The proverbs",["H4912"]],["of Solomon.",["H8010"]],["A wise",["H2450"]],["son",["H1121"]],["maketh a glad",["H8055"]],["father:",["H1"]],["but a foolish",["H3684"]],["son",["H1121"]],["is the heaviness",["H8424"]],["of his mother.",[]]]},{"verse":2,"text":"Treasures of wickedness profit nothing: but righteousness delivereth from death.","words":[["Treasures",["H214"]],["of wickedness",["H7562"]],["profit",["H3276"]],["nothing: but righteousness",["H6666"]],["delivereth",["H5337"]],["from death.",[]]]},{"verse":3,"text":"The Lord will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish: but he casteth away the substance of the wicked.","words":[["The Lord",["H3068"]],["will not suffer",["H7456"]],["the soul",["H5315"]],["of the righteous",["H6662"]],["to famish:",["H7456"]],["but he casteth away",["H1920"]],["the substance",["H1942"]],["of the wicked.",[]]]},{"verse":4,"text":"He becometh poor that dealeth with a slack hand: but the hand of the diligent maketh rich.","words":[["He becometh poor",["H7326"]],["that dealeth",["H6213"]],["with a slack",["H7423"]],["hand:",["H3709"]],["but the hand",["H3027"]],["of the diligent",["H2742"]],["maketh rich.",[]]]},{"verse":5,"text":"He that gathereth in summer is a wise son: but he that sleepeth in harvest is a son that causeth shame.","words":[["He that gathereth",["H103"]],["in summer",["H7019"]],["is a wise",["H7919"]],["son:",["H1121"]],["but he that sleepeth",["H7290"]],["in harvest",["H7105"]],["is a son",["H1121"]],["that causeth shame.",[]]]},{"verse":6,"text":"Blessings are upon the head of the just: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.","words":[["Blessings",["H1293"]],["are upon the head",["H7218"]],["of the just:",["H6662"]],["but violence",["H2555"]],["covereth",["H3680"]],["the mouth",["H6310"]],["of the wicked.",[]]]},{"verse":7,"text":"The memory of the just is blessed: but the name of the wicked shall rot.","words":[["The memory",["H2143"]],["of the just",["H6662"]],["is blessed:",["H1293"]],["but the name",["H8034"]],["of the wicked",["H7563"]],["shall rot.",[]]]},{"verse":8,"text":"The wise in heart will receive commandments: but a prating fool shall fall.","words":[["The wise",["H2450"]],["in heart",["H3820"]],["will receive",["H3947"]],["commandments:",["H4687"]],["but a prating",["H8193"]],["fool",["H191"]],["shall fall.",[]]]},{"verse":9,"text":"He that walketh uprightly walketh surely: but he that perverteth his ways shall be known.","words":[["He that walketh",["H3212"]],["uprightly",["H8537"]],["walketh",["H1980"]],["surely:",["H983"]],["but he that perverteth",["H6140"]],["his ways",["H1870"]],["shall be known.",[]]]},{"verse":10,"text":"He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow: but a prating fool shall fall.","words":[["He that winketh",["H7169"]],["with the eye",["H5869"]],["causeth",["H5414"]],["sorrow:",["H6094"]],["but a prating",["H8193"]],["fool",["H191"]],["shall fall.",[]]]},{"verse":11,"text":"The mouth of a righteous man is a well of life: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked.","words":[["The mouth",["H6310"]],["of a righteous",["H6662"]],["man is a well",["H4726"]],["of life:",["H2416"]],["but violence",["H2555"]],["covereth",["H3680"]],["the mouth",["H6310"]],["of the wicked.",[]]]},{"verse":12,"text":"Hatred stirreth up strifes: but love covereth all sins.","words":[["Hatred",["H8135"]],["stirreth up",["H5782"]],["strifes:",["H4090"]],["but love",["H160"]],["covereth",["H3680"]],["all sins.",[]]]},{"verse":13,"text":"In the lips of him that hath understanding wisdom is found: but a rod is for the back of him that is void of understanding.","words":[["In the lips",["H8193"]],["of him that hath understanding",["H995"]],["wisdom",["H2451"]],["is found:",["H4672"]],["but a rod",["H7626"]],["is for the back",["H1460"]],["of him that is void",["H2638"]],["of understanding.",[]]]},{"verse":14,"text":"Wise men lay up knowledge: but the mouth of the foolish is near destruction.","words":[["Wise",["H2450"]],["men lay up",["H6845"]],["knowledge:",["H1847"]],["but the mouth",["H6310"]],["of the foolish",["H191"]],["is near",["H7138"]],["destruction.",[]]]},{"verse":15,"text":"The rich man’s wealth is his strong city: the destruction of the poor is their poverty.","words":[["The rich man’s wealth",["H1952"]],["is his strong",["H5797"]],["city:",["H7151"]],["the destruction",["H4288"]],["of the poor",["H1800"]],["is their poverty.",[]]]},{"verse":16,"text":"The labour of the righteous tendeth to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin.","words":[["The labour",["H6468"]],["of the righteous",["H6662"]],["tendeth to life:",["H2416"]],["the fruit",["H8393"]],["of the wicked",["H7563"]],["to sin.",[]]]},{"verse":17,"text":"He is in the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth.","words":[["He is in the way",["H734"]],["of life",["H2416"]],["that keepeth",["H8104"]],["instruction:",["H4148"]],["but he that refuseth",["H5800"]],["reproof",["H8433"]],["erreth.",[]]]},{"verse":18,"text":"He that hideth hatred with lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander, is a fool.","words":[["He that hideth",["H3680"]],["hatred",["H8135"]],["with lying",["H8267"]],["lips,",["H8193"]],["and he that uttereth",["H3318"]],["a slander,",["H1681"]],["is a fool.",[]]]},{"verse":19,"text":"In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips is wise.","words":[["In the multitude",["H7230"]],["of words",["H1697"]],["there wanteth",["H2308"]],["not sin:",["H6588"]],["but he that refraineth",["H2820"]],["his lips",["H8193"]],["is wise.",[]]]},{"verse":20,"text":"The tongue of the just is as choice silver: the heart of the wicked is little worth.","words":[["The tongue",["H3956"]],["of the just",["H6662"]],["is as choice",["H977"]],["silver:",["H3701"]],["the heart",["H3820"]],["of the wicked",["H7563"]],["is little worth.",[]]]},{"verse":21,"text":"The lips of the righteous feed many: but fools die for want of wisdom.","words":[["The lips",["H8193"]],["of the righteous",["H6662"]],["feed",["H7462"]],["many:",["H7227"]],["but fools",["H191"]],["die",["H4191"]],["for want",["H2638"]],["of wisdom.",[]]]},{"verse":22,"text":"The blessing of the Lord, it maketh rich, and he addeth no sorrow with it.","words":[["The blessing",["H1293"]],["of the Lord,",["H3068"]],["it maketh rich,",["H6238"]],["and he addeth",["H3254"]],["no sorrow with it.",[]]]},{"verse":23,"text":"It is as sport to a fool to do mischief: but a man of understanding hath wisdom.","words":[["It is as sport",["H7814"]],["to a fool",["H3684"]],["to do",["H6213"]],["mischief:",["H2154"]],["but a man",["H376"]],["of understanding",["H8394"]],["hath wisdom.",[]]]},{"verse":24,"text":"The fear of the wicked, it shall come upon him: but the desire of the righteous shall be granted.","words":[["The fear",["H4034"]],["of the wicked,",["H7563"]],["it shall come",["H935"]],["upon him: but the desire",["H8378"]],["of the righteous",["H6662"]],["shall be granted.",[]]]},{"verse":25,"text":"As the whirlwind passeth, so is the wicked no more: but the righteous is an everlasting foundation.","words":[["As the whirlwind",["H5492"]],["passeth,",["H5674"]],["so is the wicked",["H7563"]],["no more: but the righteous",["H6662"]],["is an everlasting",["H5769"]],["foundation.",[]]]},{"verse":26,"text":"As vinegar to the teeth, and as smoke to the eyes, so is the sluggard to them that send him.","words":[["As vinegar",["H2558"]],["to the teeth,",["H8127"]],["and as smoke",["H6227"]],["to the eyes,",["H5869"]],["so is the sluggard",["H6102"]],["to them that send him.",[]]]},{"verse":27,"text":"The fear of the Lord prolongeth days: but the years of the wicked shall be shortened.","words":[["The fear",["H3374"]],["of the Lord",["H3068"]],["prolongeth",["H3254"]],["days:",["H3117"]],["but the years",["H8141"]],["of the wicked",["H7563"]],["shall be shortened.",[]]]},{"verse":28,"text":"The hope of the righteous shall be gladness: but the expectation of the wicked shall perish.","words":[["The hope",["H8431"]],["of the righteous",["H6662"]],["shall be gladness:",["H8057"]],["but the expectation",["H8615"]],["of the wicked",["H7563"]],["shall perish.",[]]]},{"verse":29,"text":"The way of the Lord is strength to the upright: but destruction shall be to the workers of iniquity.","words":[["The way",["H1870"]],["of the Lord",["H3068"]],["is strength",["H4581"]],["to the upright:",["H8537"]],["but destruction",["H4288"]],["shall be to the workers",["H6466"]],["of iniquity.",[]]]},{"verse":30,"text":"The righteous shall never be removed: but the wicked shall not inhabit the earth.","words":[["The righteous",["H6662"]],["shall never",["H5769"]],["be removed:",["H4131"]],["but the wicked",["H7563"]],["shall not inhabit",["H7931"]],["the earth.",[]]]},{"verse":31,"text":"The mouth of the just bringeth forth wisdom: but the froward tongue shall be cut out.","words":[["The mouth",["H6310"]],["of the just",["H6662"]],["bringeth forth",["H5107"]],["wisdom:",["H2451"]],["but the froward",["H8419"]],["tongue",["H3956"]],["shall be cut out.",[]]]},{"verse":32,"text":"The lips of the righteous know what is acceptable: but the mouth of the wicked speaketh frowardness.","words":[["The lips",["H8193"]],["of the righteous",["H6662"]],["know",["H3045"]],["what is acceptable:",["H7522"]],["but the mouth",["H6310"]],["of the wicked",["H7563"]],["speaketh frowardness.",[]]]}]}